<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch post Dfl 3.8 billion Sept trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Dutch post Dfl 3.8 billion Sept trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch trade surplus widened to a provisional 3.8 billion guilders in September 1996 from 3.3 billion in August 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p>DUTCH TRADE BALANCE    Sept 96	Aug  96	Sept 95</p>
<p> exports		    29.4	  25.5	   27.9</p>
<p> imports		    25.6	  22.1	   24.2</p>
<p> trade balance	    +3.8	  +3.3	   +3.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchandise trade in billions of guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
